                <note rend="inline" type="source">721.23/2311: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Brazil</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Gibson</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Rio de
                                Janeiro</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1934-05-18T21:00:00-03:00">May 18, 1934—9
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received May 18—8:28 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>91. Mello Franco informs me full agreement reached on Leticia question this
                    evening. He is so telegraphing Secretary General of the League of Nations. Final
                    signature probably next week.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Gibson</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
